        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Vertical Horizon, LCD Soundsystem, RCA\n- Products: Running on Ice, \"North American Scum\"\n- Places: Georgetown University, Washington, D.C., Brooklyn, New York\n\nFacts:\n- Vertical Horizon is an American alternative rock band formed at Georgetown University in Washington, D.C., in 1991.\n- Running on Ice is the second album by Vertical Horizon, and Vertical Horizon released it independently in 1995 before RCA later re-released it.\n- LCD Soundsystem is an American rock band from Brooklyn, New York, formed in 2002.\n- \"North American Scum\" is a song by the American rock band LCD Soundsystem.",
